{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R8VSaGaBmxX4tByP6DKHj4","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Implementation Plan\n     2→Generated: 2026-03-19T00:00:00Z\n     3→Total_Items: 19\n     4→Completed: 1\n     5→Test_Items: 9 (target: ≥70% of implementation items → 9/11 = 82%)\n     6→\n     7→## Dependency Graph\n     8→```\n     9→Independent_Groups:\n    10→  - group_1: [Item 1, Item 2, Item 3]                         # models, DTOs, schema — no dependencies\n    11→  - group_2: [Item 4, Item 5, Item 6, Item 7, Item 8]         # config, mapper, validator, test infra — depends on group_1\n    12→  - group_3: [Item 9, Item 10, Item 11, Item 12, Item 13, Item 14]  # service, exception handler, early tests — depends on group_2\n    13→  - group_4: [Item 15, Item 16]                                # service tests, controller — depends on group_3\n    14→  - group_5: [Item 17, Item 18, Item 19]                       # controller integration tests — depends on group_4\n    15→Build_Order: group_1 → group_2 → group_3 → group_4 → group_5\n    16→```\n    17→\n    18→---\n    19→\n    20→## Item 1: Employee model class\n    21→- status: DONE\n    22→- priority: P0\n    23→- complexity: S\n    24→- depends_on: []\n    25→- spec: specs/employee-crud-api.md\n    26→- clarity_ref: CLARITY_LOG.md#Round-1 (R1.9 date format, R1.20 timestamp format)\n    27→- description: Create the Employee entity in `com.example.legacy.model` with fields: id (Long), name (String), email (String), department (String), salary (BigDecimal), hireDate (Date), createdAt (Timestamp), updatedAt (Timestamp). Add Jackson annotations for date serialization — hireDate as \"yyyy-MM-dd\", timestamps as \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss\". Standard getters/setters, Java 1.8 style.\n    28→- acceptance: Class compiles. Fields match spec types. Jackson annotations produce correct date formats when serialized.\n    29→- tests: Covered by Item 11 (Model & DTO unit tests)\n    30→\n    31→## Item 2: Request/Response DTOs\n    32→- status: DONE\n    33→- priority: P0\n    34→- complexity: S\n    35→- depends_on: []\n    36→- spec: specs/employee-crud-api.md\n    37→- clarity_ref: CLARITY_LOG.md#Round-1 (R1.3 fieldErrors, R1.13 email validation, R1.20 error timestamp)\n    38→- description: Create EmployeeRequest DTO in `com.example.legacy.dto` with javax.validation annotations — name (@NotBlank, @Size max=100), email (@NotBlank, @Email), department (@NotBlank, @Size max=50), salary (@NotNull, @DecimalMin(\"0\")), hireDate (@NotNull). Create ErrorResponse DTO with fields: status (int), message (String), timestamp (String, ISO 8601), fieldErrors (List of FieldError inner class with field + message).\n    39→- acceptance: Classes compile. Validation annotations are present and correct. ErrorResponse includes fieldErrors list.\n    40→- tests: Covered by Item 11 (Model & DTO unit tests)\n    41→\n    42→## Item 3: Database schema and test resources\n    43→- status: DONE\n    44→- priority: P0\n    45→- complexity: S\n    46→- depends_on: []\n    47→- spec: specs/employee-crud-api.md\n    48→- clarity_ref: CLARITY_LOG.md#Round-1 (R1.11 H2 compatibility, R1.12 test profile)\n    49→- description: Create `src/main/resources/schema.sql` with PostgreSQL-compatible DDL for the employees table (id BIGSERIAL PK, name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL, email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE, department VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, salary DECIMAL(19,2) NOT NULL CHECK >= 0, hire_date DATE NOT NULL, created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP). Create `src/test/resources/schema.sql` (H2-compatible version) and `src/test/resources/application-test.properties` with H2 MODE=PostgreSQL config.\n    50→- acceptance: Schema files exist. H2 test schema uses compatible syntax (BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT instead of BIGSERIAL). Test properties configure H2 with PostgreSQL mode.\n    51→- tests: Validated indirectly by Item 12 (EmployeeMapper integr